---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---
<div class="mkt-architecture">
  <div class="mkt-architecture-entry"><span class="mkt-micro">YOUR APPLICATION</span><span class="mkt-architecture-entry-code">A URL. One API call.</span><Icon name="down" size={20}/></div>
  <div class="mkt-architecture-layers">
    <article class="mkt-engine-card"><div class="mkt-layer-heading"><span class="mkt-layer-icon"><Icon name="route" size={22}/></span><span class="mkt-micro">01 / ACCESS ENGINE</span><span class="mkt-tag">AUTO MODE</span></div><h3>The cheapest route<br/>that works.</h3><p>Direct, datacenter and residential routes, tried in order, with fresh IPs on rate limits and what worked remembered per site.</p><div class="mkt-layer-endpoint"><span>POST</span><code>/v1/fetch</code></div></article>
    <article class="mkt-engine-card"><div class="mkt-layer-heading"><span class="mkt-layer-icon mkt-icon-cyan"><Icon name="layers" size={22}/></span><span class="mkt-micro">02 / BROWSER</span><span class="mkt-tag">CAMOUFOX</span></div><h3>When a page<br/>needs a browser.</h3><p>A hardened Firefox renders JavaScript pages and solves Turnstile, reCAPTCHA and hCaptcha, with a locale that matches the exit country.</p><div class="mkt-layer-endpoint"><span>render</span><code>auto | always</code></div></article>
    <article class="mkt-engine-card mkt-proposed-layer"><div class="mkt-layer-heading"><span class="mkt-layer-icon"><Icon name="grid" size={22}/></span><span class="mkt-micro">03 / OUTPUTS</span><span class="mkt-tag">FORMATS</span></div><h3>The data in<br/>the shape you need.</h3><p>The body as received, plus markdown, text, links, page metadata, parsed JSON or a screenshot.</p><div class="mkt-layer-endpoint"><span>formats</span><code>markdown · text · links</code></div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="mkt-architecture-base"><Icon name="lock" size={15}/><span>Project isolation</span><i></i><span>Success-only billing</span><i></i><span>Safe retries</span><i></i><span>Encrypted results</span></div>
</div>
